/// Folder holding the csv files written by src/export_powerbi.py. This is the
/// one place a path is configured. Every table in the model builds its file
/// name from it, so pointing the model at a different export means changing
/// this value and nothing else.
///
/// Set it in Power BI Desktop under Home, Transform data, Edit parameters.
///
/// Power Query has no notion of the project folder, so this has to be an
/// absolute path. The folder it should point at, in repo terms, is
/// ..\data\powerbi_fixture\export relative to this powerbi folder. Written out
/// in full on the machine this was authored on, that is the default below.
/// Change it to wherever the repo sits on yours.
expression DataFolder = "C:\Users\Mush\Desktop\projects\cbam-screen\data\powerbi_fixture\export" meta [IsParameterQuery=true, Type="Text", IsParameterQueryRequired=true]

	annotation PBI_ResultType = Text
